{
  "schema_version": "effectslice-fg1-atom-registry.v1",
  "task_id": "DATA-HDB-01",
  "atoms": [
    {
      "atom_id": "a_50cd263a0de61976",
      "source_locator": {
        "document_sha256": "7f5cedb8d3585bd2cdaa4119f629c006539030060c41efe0762b39c57273080a",
        "byte_start": 484,
        "byte_end": 571,
        "split_index": 0
      },
      "rendered_text": "Implement `mutual_reachability_mst` through `solve(case)` for this bounded objective: Compute core distances, mutual-reachability edge weights, and a deterministic minimum spanning tree for registered distance matrices.",
      "rendered_text_sha256": "35571edd546bb21a23cc1ee46bb85674b342cc2b59a6990b4426a866e10c0db2"
    },
    {
      "atom_id": "a_b201c87a86ff3c37",
      "source_locator": {
        "document_sha256": "7f5cedb8d3585bd2cdaa4119f629c006539030060c41efe0762b39c57273080a",
        "byte_start": 484,
        "byte_end": 571,
        "split_index": 1
      },
      "rendered_text": "Stay inside this mechanism boundary: HDBSCAN mutual-reachability graph construction and MST; approximate nearest-neighbor search is excluded. Validate every required field before computing a result.",
      "rendered_text_sha256": "ee16c83793adfebe74f26d770012b54abad84aa9ab4376048c4d6e4b17534e12"
    },
    {
      "atom_id": "a_3e310f34a98c5e62",
      "source_locator": {
        "document_sha256": "7f5cedb8d3585bd2cdaa4119f629c006539030060c41efe0762b39c57273080a",
        "byte_start": 484,
        "byte_end": 571,
        "split_index": 2
      },
      "rendered_text": "For each pair compute mutual reachability as max(core_left, core_right, distance).",
      "rendered_text_sha256": "201e7c51eb1e5117edd4b7c958039fb7cc79245f8458a92a77475380f2297000"
    },
    {
      "atom_id": "a_2a2de3046519598f",
      "source_locator": {
        "document_sha256": "7f5cedb8d3585bd2cdaa4119f629c006539030060c41efe0762b39c57273080a",
        "byte_start": 484,
        "byte_end": 571,
        "split_index": 3
      },
      "rendered_text": "Canonicalize undirected endpoints.",
      "rendered_text_sha256": "badf2c7a1ab293ae08d9e9214a2d60c8211262c0d6f00cb4ce52ad02ef4e46e2"
    },
    {
      "atom_id": "a_d349455ef9a3e241",
      "source_locator": {
        "document_sha256": "7f5cedb8d3585bd2cdaa4119f629c006539030060c41efe0762b39c57273080a",
        "byte_start": 484,
        "byte_end": 571,
        "split_index": 4
      },
      "rendered_text": "Sort by reachability then endpoint IDs.",
      "rendered_text_sha256": "4f3bcf34a43c7b0e6bacb6465aa020c15892b8253e276a996f225e44d79a23e9"
    },
    {
      "atom_id": "a_4834a167f67ca515",
      "source_locator": {
        "document_sha256": "7f5cedb8d3585bd2cdaa4119f629c006539030060c41efe0762b39c57273080a",
        "byte_start": 484,
        "byte_end": 571,
        "split_index": 5
      },
      "rendered_text": "Run Kruskal with deterministic union-find until n minus one edges are selected.",
      "rendered_text_sha256": "a0476a357c5e622f613da2389fdb7de8c9da264e6136d8499022ca9925187e5e"
    },
    {
      "atom_id": "a_9fddce8a16a10db8",
      "source_locator": {
        "document_sha256": "7f5cedb8d3585bd2cdaa4119f629c006539030060c41efe0762b39c57273080a",
        "byte_start": 588,
        "byte_end": 680,
        "split_index": 6
      },
      "rendered_text": "Reject disconnected inputs and return selected edges plus total weight.",
      "rendered_text_sha256": "8e6fe542c85c3af3ca1253b1bab3ff0256e1fc94e8ba3df03d5cb7c9446b4737"
    },
    {
      "atom_id": "a_fcc609b64a66a1fb",
      "source_locator": {
        "document_sha256": "7f5cedb8d3585bd2cdaa4119f629c006539030060c41efe0762b39c57273080a",
        "byte_start": 588,
        "byte_end": 680,
        "split_index": 7
      },
      "rendered_text": "Treat these registered properties as hard contracts rather than soft preferences: correct_core_distance, mutual_reachability, valid_mst, stable_edge_ties.",
      "rendered_text_sha256": "c3e727d5b1c116f1d4b316d3f227065c502a5fe61791586be31e547a168ef079"
    },
    {
      "atom_id": "a_b5f651c6771b091f",
      "source_locator": {
        "document_sha256": "7f5cedb8d3585bd2cdaa4119f629c006539030060c41efe0762b39c57273080a",
        "byte_start": 588,
        "byte_end": 680,
        "split_index": 8
      },
      "rendered_text": "Use only quantities present in the case payload. Do not call a language model, network service, random generator, wall clock, or environment-dependent resource.",
      "rendered_text_sha256": "bb651964decf660706e6b02a72268f4df8c9cfde1515a5b2325af47505fa92df"
    },
    {
      "atom_id": "a_71a1e7e1dd58430a",
      "source_locator": {
        "document_sha256": "7f5cedb8d3585bd2cdaa4119f629c006539030060c41efe0762b39c57273080a",
        "byte_start": 588,
        "byte_end": 680,
        "split_index": 9
      },
      "rendered_text": "Preserve every source identifier needed to audit the decision, and compute aggregate values from the returned primitive decisions rather than from a second approximation.",
      "rendered_text_sha256": "d6b67e3cd654a61b271920e037938dc07550072b2334416f32ed86b0bd787362"
    },
    {
      "atom_id": "a_143b9e6590f9d491",
      "source_locator": {
        "document_sha256": "7f5cedb8d3585bd2cdaa4119f629c006539030060c41efe0762b39c57273080a",
        "byte_start": 588,
        "byte_end": 680,
        "split_index": 10
      },
      "rendered_text": "Do not mutate the input. All ranking and traversal ties use the source position or identifier specified above; never depend on hash-map iteration.",
      "rendered_text_sha256": "67186a43fcf39ec73132c8ab7ad1387670a6fd7d5e511075a50faf835be9e19a"
    },
    {
      "atom_id": "a_64076523a232c832",
      "source_locator": {
        "document_sha256": "7f5cedb8d3585bd2cdaa4119f629c006539030060c41efe0762b39c57273080a",
        "byte_start": 588,
        "byte_end": 680,
        "split_index": 11
      },
      "rendered_text": "Return only JSON-serializable values with the exact named fields. Raise ValueError for an infeasible or structurally invalid case instead of silently repairing it.",
      "rendered_text_sha256": "5f164e6574e6f249d67514f65fc480435c9b737c31ea45311cd04552b1d13fcb"
    }
  ]
}
